  "description_short": "Artisan coffee roastery and cafe in Yellowwoods Centre serving quality brews and wholesome food.",
  "description_long": "Bootlegger Yellowwoods brings serious coffee culture to Plettenberg Bay's Yellowwoods Centre. This artisan roastery and cafe serves carefully crafted espresso drinks alongside a menu of wholesome breakfast and lunch options. The space balances the buzz of a proper coffee shop with a relaxed atmosphere where you can linger over a flat white and a light meal.\n\nTheir coffee is roasted with care, and it shows in every cup. The food menu keeps things fresh and uncomplicated — think well-executed breakfast bowls, sandwiches, and baked goods that pair perfectly with their specialty drinks. It's the sort of place that works equally well for a quick takeaway coffee on your way through town or settling in with your laptop for the afternoon.\n\nLocated conveniently on Main Street in the Yellowwoods Centre, it's an easy stop whether you're a local regular or just passing through the Garden Route. The vibe is casual and welcoming, with staff who know their coffee and aren't precious about it.",
